### Soyuz UI strings (en-US source): tui-workspaces
### The terminal UI: workspaces: Save as…, Manage, tab history, About (Phase T7).
### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-workspaces.ftl.

## Save workspace as…

tui-workspaces-name = Name
tui-workspaces-name-empty = Enter a name for the workspace
tui-workspaces-save-hints = Enter save · Esc cancel

## Manage workspaces

tui-workspaces-hotkey = Hotkey
tui-workspaces-manage-hints = Up/Down workspace · Enter open · F2 edit · Alt+Up move up · Del delete (no undo) · Esc close
tui-workspaces-edit-hints = Tab next · Enter done · Esc stop editing

## Tab history ("Where was I?")

tui-workspaces-history-hints = Up/Down place · Enter go there · Esc close

## About

tui-workspaces-about-hints = C copy info · Enter / Esc close
